<!--
    TD 71507 - review issue 1: an incoming purchase from an UNKNOWN supplier on an account with option SPSC
    ("Skip PEPPOL supplier creation"). The supplier is not created; its data lands raw in PURCHASES.SUPPLIER_JSON.
    Purchase line names are stripped by the PR, the supplier name/address in SUPPLIER_JSON are not.

    Before sending:
      - enable option SPSC on the target account
      - make sure no client has VATCODE BE0999715070 (otherwise the supplier is found and SUPPLIER_JSON stays empty)
      - the receiver lookup uses the webhook body (peppol_html_inject.http), not this file
-->
